Date: Fri, 5 Dec 2025 15:43:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 943/954] feat(stm32mp1): add PSCI OSI low-power request

We add two flags:
 - STM32_PM_CPU_STANDBY_FLAG to direct the secondary CPU to a WFI loop.
 - STM32_PM_CARE_OTHER_CPU_STATE_FLAG to make sure the secondary CPU is
blocked in its WFI loop when the primary CPU disabled the DDR.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git bae7d90fd93e81828b1fd799c2381ecb31328832 feat(stm32mp1): add PSCI OSI low-power request]
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
